    "group": "Steel Hammer",
    "summary": "Whenever one of your ASTRA MILITARUM TITANIC or ASTRA MILITARUM SQUADRON units is picked to shoot, its models may target enemy units within its Engagement Range, Blast weapons included, as long as that enemy has no other friendly unit within its Engagement Range. While doing this, those models ignore the Hit roll penalty for shooting while enemy units are within Engagement Range, except for attacks with Indirect Fire weapons.",
